            "@flag_str:<ref>": "same id as a decimal string, which is how a flag dependency stores it",
            "object keys": "a token used as a JSON object key resolves to the decimal string form"
        },
        "ordering": "Both seeders insert in file order, so ids ascend in file order. The golden relies on that: it lists id-sorted arrays in file order."
